  "description": "The MAUI MaterialFrame aims at delivering out of the box modern popular theming such as:\n* Light\n* Dark\n* Acrylic\n* AcrylicBlur\n\nThe AcrylicBlur theme also provides three different blur styles inherited from the iOS UIVisualEffectView:\n* Light\n* ExtraLight\n* Dark\n\nOn Android, the blur is implemented with StackBlur algorithm - a pure C# implementation that works on all Android versions including 15+ with 16KB page size.\n## Installation\n\n* In Core project, in `MauiProgram.cs`:\n\n```csharp\npublic static MauiApp CreateMauiApp()\n{\n    var builder = MauiApp.CreateBuilder();\n    builder\n        .UseMauiApp()\n        .UseSharpnadoMaterialFrame(loggerEnabled: false);\n}\n```",
